					"children": [
						{
							"type": "text",
							"value": "A documented list of specific elements that are blocked, per policy decision. This concept has historically been known as a “blacklist.”"
						}
					]
				}
			],
			"translation": {
				"content": [
					{
						"type": "paragraph",
						"children": [
							{
								"type": "text",
								"value": "ポリシーに基づく決定によって拒否される特定の要素を記載したリスト。この概念は、従来は「ブラックリスト」と呼ばれていた。"
							}
						]
					}
				],
				"sourceHash": "692c7849a2c83739754f0814b561ed912ea3544257a432e6b2aefd65d730c0bd"
